{"version":1,"content":"<p>岑寧兒（Yoyo）繼《光透進來的地方》後，今日（15日）推出今年第二首國語作品《古董相機》，首次邀請台灣唱作歌手魏如萱為她作曲，以一部舊菲林相機，寫下關於時間、失去與回憶的故事。</p><p>歌曲看似傷感，卻藏着溫柔的祝福。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:20:55.868565+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T13:37:37.717758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:17:41.703297+00:00","content_hash":"96731796afc9328fbce78079424f5f7af07b442eea2f83918480ecc421dd16d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}